{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Love and Lie - Addictive as a woman, complicated as relationships.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The most realistic digital dating experience ever made.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Love and Lie</strong>, where every message, glance, and silence can change everything.<br>This isn\u2019t just a dating simulator \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>living, breathing world of love, deception, and chaos</strong>, powered by AI personalities that actually think, feel, and react like real people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If <i>The Sims</i> had Tinder\u2026 and a moral compass that broke years ago - you\u2019d get <strong>Love and Lie</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/1ed11750ab46b7b3a95a20628660e60d.poster.avif?t=1765882442\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/1ed11750ab46b7b3a95a20628660e60d.webm?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/1ed11750ab46b7b3a95a20628660e60d.mp4?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc94 <strong>In a world where love is a game - your job is to win it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the \u201c<strong>Thunder Love</strong>\u201d dating app to start your journey.<br>Choose who you are: a lonely bachelor, a married man looking for \u201csomething different,\u201d or a freshly divorced romantic ready for chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Flirt, lie, seduce, or confess - whatever it takes. <br>Be charming. Be cunning. Cheat if you must.<br>How many hearts can you collect before they all break at once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every woman you meet is unique -\u00a0<strong>smart, emotional, unpredictable,</strong> and <strong>addictive</strong> in her own way.<br>Some crave honesty. Others crave adventure.<br>And some? Just want to see if you\u2019ll tell the truth when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>AI-Driven Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every NPC is powered by advanced artificial intelligence - not scripted. <br>They listen to your voice. They remember what you say.<br>They get jealous, suspicious, or surprisingly forgiving.<br>Each one has a job, a past, and a daily life - and you\u2019re just one unexpected text away from changing it forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/2ae681f72e61a83bb86c6099608edded.poster.avif?t=1765882442\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/2ae681f72e61a83bb86c6099608edded.webm?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/2ae681f72e61a83bb86c6099608edded.mp4?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>Your words. Your world. Your mess.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget dialogue wheels - here, you <strong>type what you actually want to say</strong>.<br>Every conversation is freeform, and every line you write can turn into love, laughter, or disaster.<br>Try to sweet-talk your way out of a scandal, juggle three lovers at once, or escape from a jealous husband in a stealth mission.<br>In <i>Love and Lie</i>, flirting is an art\u2026 and lying is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf06 <strong>A city full of possibilities \u2014 and consequences.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From casual hookups on <i>Thunder Love</i> to complex romances with local residents, your story unfolds in an open world where your choices have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Meet hundreds of AI-driven characters \u2014 each with their own schedules, ambitions, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tier 1 - The App:</strong> Swipe, match, and practice your lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tier 2 - The Locals:</strong> Win over real personalities with quests, gifts, and genuine effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tier 3 - The Legends:</strong> Unlock hidden, high-stakes romances reserved for the city\u2019s most legendary charmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/cf71fa3ef3c095a14ea583e2e67df516.poster.avif?t=1765882442\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/cf71fa3ef3c095a14ea583e2e67df516.webm?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/cf71fa3ef3c095a14ea583e2e67df516.mp4?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2764\ufe0f <strong>More than a dating sim \u2014 it\u2019s life itself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Love and Lie is a <strong>sandbox life simulator</strong> where relationships are just the beginning.<br>Pay your bills, fix your car, manage your hunger and hygiene, and still find time to text your secret girlfriend before bed.<br>Because in this world, <strong>love is work - and lies are maintenance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc8b <strong>She\u2019s not just a feature \u2014 she\u2019s the whole game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every major system in <i>Love and Lie</i> reflects a side of her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Free-Text Dialogue System</strong> - Type your own lines; the AI reacts dynamically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AI-Driven NPCs</strong> - Fully voiced, emotionally responsive characters with memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>High-Stakes Romance</strong> - Date, deceive, or destroy \u2014 every lie has a consequence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Life Simulation</strong> - Work, eat, sleep, fix, hustle, and love in a living city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stealth &amp; Strategy</strong> - Escape jealous partners or suspicious spouses in tense scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RPG Progression</strong> - Build charm, intelligence, and reputation to unlock new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> - No scripts. No limits. Just human unpredictability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fully offline</strong>\u00a0- No data is collected, your game, and information is 100% private\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/96d0a4bffe625323936f1c15c4ff36d6.poster.avif?t=1765882442\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/96d0a4bffe625323936f1c15c4ff36d6.webm?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886140/extras/96d0a4bffe625323936f1c15c4ff36d6.mp4?t=1765882442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Love and Lie \u2014 because honesty is overrated.</strong></h2><p class=\"